 2","description":"When this Operator is assigned to the Reception Room, Clue search speed increases by 10% and it's easier to obtain the clues of Ursus Student Self-Governing Group"}],"modules":[{"type":"Original","name":"Istina's Badge","stages":[]},{"type":"Upgrade","name":"DEC-Y: Reading Notes","mission":{"requirement1":"Complete a total of 5 battles; You must deploy your own Istina, and have Istina deal at least 25,000 damage","requirement2":"Clear Main Theme 2-3 with a 3-star rating; You must deploy your own Istina, and only 6 Operators are allowed for the remaining units"},"stages":[{"stage":"Stage 1","attributesIncreased":"HP +90 , ASPD +3","effectLabel":"Trait improved","effectText":"Attacks deal Arts damage , and Slow the enemy for a moderate period of time","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":2},{"name":"Crystalline Circuit","quantity":3},{"name":"LMD","quantity":40000}]},{"stage":"Stage 2","attributesIncreased":"HP +120 , ASPD +4","effectLabel":"Explorer improved","effectText":"DEF -35%; ASPD +21. While this unit's skill is active, further increase ASPD by 5","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":2},{"name":"Data Supplement Stick","quantity":20},{"name":"Manganese Trihydrate","quantity":4},{"name":"LMD","quantity":50000}]},{"stage":"Stage 3","attributesIncreased":"HP +160 , ASPD +5","effectLabel":"Explorer improved","effectText":"DEF -35%; ASPD +21. While this unit's skill is active, further increase ASPD by 10","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":2},{"name":"Data Supplement Instrument","quantity":8},{"name":"Incandescent Alloy Block","quantity":5},{"name":"LMD","quantity":60000}]}]}],"review":{"official":"Before the\nChernobog\nincident\n, Istina was a middle school student. In school, she wrote many articles about\nOriginium Arts\n. Her areas of expertise: masters of Arts, investigative articles, and sociology.\nIn a number of tests, she has demonstrated excellent control-type Originium Arts. She has been approved to assist in battle. She also provides intel and data processing services for\nRhodes Island\n.","editor":null,"rating":null},"synergies":[],"techniques":[{"technique":null,"techniqueDescription":null,"description":null}],"guides":[],"stats":{"phases":[{"elite":0,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":50,"base":{"hp":581,"atk":218,"def":46,"res":10,"redeploy":70,"dp":13,"block":1,"interval":1.9},"max":{"hp":797,"atk":321,"def":67,"res":10,"redeploy":70,"dp":13,"block":1,"interval":1.9},"rangeId":"y-2"},{"elite":1,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":70,"base":{"hp":797,"atk":321,"def":67,"res":15,"redeploy":70,"dp":15,"block":1,"interval":1.9},"max":{"hp":1024,"atk":429,"def":87,"res":15,"redeploy":70,"dp":15,"block":1,"interval":1.9},"rangeId":"y-2"},{"elite":2,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":80,"base":{"hp":1024,"atk":429,"def":87,"res":20,"redeploy":70,"dp":15,"block":1,"interval":1.9},"max":{"hp":1280,"atk":518,"def":104,"res":20,"redeploy":70,"dp":15,"block":1,"interval":1.9},"rangeId":"y-2"}],"trust":{"hp":0,"atk":65,"def":0}},"files":[{"section":"Clinical Analysis","unlock":"Unlocked by default","description":"Imaging tests reveal clear, normal outlines of internal organs, and no abnormal shadows have been detected. Originium granules have not been detected in the circulatory system and there is no sign of infection. At this time, this Operator is believed to be non-infected.\n\n[Cell-Originium Fusion Rate] 0% \nOperator shows no signs of infection at this time.\n\n[Blood Crystal Density] 0.1u/L \nThis Operator has rarely come into contact with Originium."},{"section":"Archive File 1","unlock":"Unlocked at 25 trust","description":"Istina is cool-headed and rational, though somewhat introverted. She often absorbs herself in her hobbies: the meticulous study of more profound Originium Arts, the study of the latest social theories, observation of others and their relationships, and fashion. \nOver the course of her multiple interactions with the Ursus Student Group, Istina displayed rare communication abilities and an assured manner, and gave clear and focused answers. We are certain that Istina intends to hold proactive exchanges with Rhodes Island, and may be a positive factor in communication with the Ursus Student Self-government Group."},{"section":"Archive File 2","unlock":"Unlocked at 50 trust","description":"It is now known that the 'Ursus Student Self-government Group' was originally proposed by Istina. The group's establishment helped the Ursus students work together and get past the initial phase of isolation and mutual distrust. \nDuring consultation, Istina keenly answered several questions concerning Zima. Istina believes that although Zima is rude and sometimes unreasonable, she attaches great importance to her companions in the Self-Governing Group and is a competent leader. And if she could add her own input during operations, this would be even better. \nWhile discussing Zima, the Doctor made many pointed remarks, but Istina gave opposing opinions. Istina believes that Zima will not become a destabilizing force for Rhodes Island, and that to believe that her ambitions extend only as far as Rhodes Island would be to underestimate her."},{"section":"Archive File 3","unlock":"Unlocked at 100 trust","description":"Istina was born in Chernobog, a city in the Empire of Ursus. Her parents were both employed in local agencies. During the periodic riots by student organizations, Istina declined to participate and instead chose to read quietly. As she had no interest in the loud music and partying of her peers, she began to read some particularly interesting books coming out of Londinium, Victoria at the time. From these, she started to reevalute everything she thought she knew, and began to see everything in a new light."},{"section":"Archive File 4","unlock":"Unlocked at 150 trust","description":"With regard to her whereabouts during the Chernobog incident, Istina modestly and succinctly declined to answer, but she showed several changes of emotion in doing so. On account of Rhodes Island's current policies and the need to protect certain company secrets, investigations into the Ursus Student Self-government Group have temporarily ceased. \nIn view of the background investigation into the Ursus Student Groups, there is no need to question Istina's background. Because of this, it is advisable to use psychologically founded methods to communicate with Ursus students. Future options for cooperation should be provided based on the suitability and independence of the student union members.\nNote: Based on Istina's intense level of interest in the books in the Doctor's office, it is advisable to give her a degree of reading privileges."}]},"appearances":[{"label":"Base","iconPath":"/five-star-icons/Istina%20-%20Base.webp","fullPath":"/five-star-skins/Istina%20-%20Base.webp"},{"label":"Elite 2","iconPath":"/five-star-icons/Istina%20-%20Elite%202.webp","fullPath":"/five-star-skins/Istina%20-%20Elite%202.webp"},{"label":"Bibliosmia","iconPath":"/five-star-icons/Istina%20-%20Bibliosmia.webp","fullPath":"/five-star-skins/Istina%20-%20Bibliosmia.webp"}],"skinObtainByLabel":{"Bibliosmia":"18 OP"},"synergyMatches":[],"autoSynergyGroups":[{"name":"Ursus Student Self-Governing Group","type":"faction","entries":[{"operatorName":"Rosa","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Rosa%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T2","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T2","sourceText":"When this unit is in the squad, all [Ursus Student Self-Governing Group] Operators gain +10% ATK (+2%)","matchedKeyword":"Ursus Student Self-Governing Group"}]},{"operatorName":"Zima the Raging Tide","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Zima%20the%20Raging%20Tide%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T2","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T2","sourceText":"When skill is active, all Operators gain +18% (+4%) ATK and DEF; [Ursus Student Self-Government Group] Operators receive double the effect","matchedKeyword":"Ursus Student Sel